ent-Scp096CryOut = Emit a pitiful cry
    .desc =
        Through your tears, you emit a cry capable of damaging nearby visible structures.
        Use it to crack your containment chamber and leave it.
ent-Scp096FaceSkinRip = Peel the skin from your face
    .desc =
        You slowly peel the skin from your face, carving away your hateful self.
        When your face has become an unrecognizable bloody mess, you will gain the ability to open airtight doors, airlocks, and attack people.
        And no one else will be able to see your face until it is restored!
ent-Scp096SitDown = Sit Down
    .desc = You sit in a melancholic pose.
